  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-formula-card\"><header><h3>zonal-statistics</h3><span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--derived\" data-provenance=\"derived\">curated formula</span></header><div><pre class=\"lens-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\n\\term{sums}{S_f}&amp;=\\sum_{i:\\ \\term{row}{z_i}=f,\\ \\term{valid}{v_i\\ \\text{finite}}}\\term{values}{v_i},\n&amp;\\term{means}{\\bar{v}_f}&amp;=\\frac{S_f}{\\term{valueCounts}{N_f}}\\\\\n\\term{standardDeviations}{s_f}&amp;=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\term{squaredDeviationSums}{\\sum_i(v_i-\\bar{v}_f)^2}}{N_f-1}}\n\\end{aligned}</pre><p class=\"lens-ascii\">S_f = sum of v_i over points i with zone z_i = f and v_i finite; N_f = their count; mean_f = S_f / N_f (NaN when N_f = 0); s_f = sqrt(sum (v_i - mean_f)^2 / (N_f - 1)) (NaN when N_f &lt; 2). Unweighted form. The deviation sum is a second pass about the mean. Points whose zone row is not below featureCount are unassigned and contribute to no zone.</p></div><div class=\"lens-symbols\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.zonal-statistics-compiled:zonal-statistics-means\" data-value=\"sums\">sums · output · sums</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.zonal-statistics-compiled:zonal-statistics-deviation\" data-value=\"row\">row · input · row</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.zonal-statistics-compiled:zonal-statistics-prepare\" data-value=\"valid\">valid · intermediate · valid</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.zonal-statistics-compiled:zonal-statistics-prepare\" data-value=\"values\">values · input · values</butt